.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-ls 1  "ls " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-ls \- List open tasks in a terminal\-width\-aware table
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit ls\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-wide\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List open tasks in a terminal\-width\-aware table
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-\-wide\fR
Show ids and descriptions without truncating titles
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit ls
  orbit ls \-\-all
  orbit ls \-\-wide
  orbit \-\-json ls
